  "source": "## Semantics: T1, C1, C5, C7, M0, A1\ngrammar ConformanceLookahead version \"1.0.0\" {\n  ## A key: letters not followed by an equals sign.\n  plain = 1*%x61-7A !\"=\"\n  ## A key followed by a value.\n  main = plain \" \" 1*%x61-7A\n\n  entry main: main\n\n  test main {\n    accept \"abc xyz\"\n    reject \"abc=xyz\"\n  }\n}\n",
